      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Key Management**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a key management service. I'm leaning toward Google Cloud KMS for its widespread use and commonality. The plan is to ensure that the code explicitly identifies and interacts with the chosen provider, which is likely Google Cloud KMS.\n\n\n**Defining Decryption Logic**\n\nI've formulated a plan to create `decrypt_payload.py`, focusing on Google Cloud KMS for the decryption. The script will take project details and ciphertext as input, utilizing a KMS client library to decrypt. Imports and client instantiation will make the provider explicitly identifiable within the code.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864497534,
          "start": 1789864495808
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc3ccac0001e27Xq4rWXWCynZ",
